# SECURITY RULE — access/ directory
# access/keys.txt contains live Scout access keys.
# It must NEVER be committed to git.
# The access/ directory must NEVER contain anything
# other than keys.txt and keys_generate.py (now moved).
# If you are about to add a file to access/ — stop.
# Keys and credentials live on VPS only.
# Code lives in git only. Never mix them.
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
venv/
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
access/keys.txt
sessions/
sessions/flask_sessions/
sessions/transcripts/
run_local.bat